  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The United Nations Population Fund on Sexual and Reproductive Health and Rights</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the Programme is to contribute towards enhancing utilization of SRHR and GBV services among young people and women in Northern Uganda, including refugees, for healthy and productive lives. These shall be achieved through 3 outputs
Output 1. Women and young people are empowered to demand their SRHR and gender rights and to access socio-economic asset building opportunities.
Output 2: Duty bearers provide integrated and quality SRHR and GBV information and services, which are responsive to the needs of women and young people.
Output 3: Young leaders are identified and nurtured to develop and implement break-through solutions for the improvement of SRHR and GBV outcomes</narrative>
  </description>
